<!doctype html><html lang="tr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Site içerikleri</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui;background:#f5f7f5;color:#26332b;margin:0}.wrap{max-width:850px;margin:35px auto;padding:0 20px}.panel{background:white;padding:26px;border-radius:16px}label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin:17px 0}input,textarea{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:12px;border:1px solid #dfe6e0;border-radius:9px;margin-top:7px;font:inherit}textarea{min-height:90px}.btn{background:#176b50;color:white;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 20px;font-weight:750}
/* Consistent admin links and actions */
a{color:#176b50;text-decoration:none;transition:color .18s ease,background-color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}a:hover{color:#104c39;text-decoration:none}td a:not([class]),.table-wrap a:not([class]){display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid #dce9e0;border-radius:8px;background:#f5faf6;color:#176b50;font-size:12px;font-weight:750;white-space:nowrap}td a:not([class]):hover,.table-wrap a:not([class]):hover{background:#eaf4ee;border-color:#b9d8c4}button,input[type=submit]{cursor:pointer;font:inherit}button{transition:filter .18s ease,transform .18s ease}button:hover,input[type=submit]:hover{filter:brightness(.96)}
</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><h1>Web sitesi içerikleri</h1><p>Ana sayfa başlıklarını, açıklamaları ve site adını buradan düzenleyebilirsiniz.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/content"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?= e(csrf_token()) ?>"><div class="panel"><?php $exploreGroupShown=false; foreach($contentFields as $key=>$label): if(str_starts_with($key,'explore_')&&!$exploreGroupShown): $exploreGroupShown=true; ?><div style="margin:30px 0 16px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:#f0f6f0;border:1px solid #dce9dd"><h2 style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#1d5039">Premium Keşfet Drawer</h2><p style="margin:0;color:#68796d;font-size:13px">Bu bölümdeki tüm başlıkları, açıklamaları, görselleri ve bağlantıları buradan yönetebilirsiniz. Görseller için tam URL veya site içi dosya yolu kullanın. Her görsel alanında önizleme bulunur.</p></div><?php endif; ?><label><?= e($label) ?><?php if(in_array($key,['home_subtitle','featured_subtitle','footer_text','home_latest_subtitle','home_trust_1_text','home_trust_2_text','home_trust_3_text','home_trust_4_text','home_concepts_subtitle','home_collections_subtitle','home_regions_subtitle','home_reviews_subtitle','home_faq_subtitle','home_faq_1_answer','home_faq_2_answer','home_faq_3_answer','home_faq_4_answer','home_faq_5_answer','home_support_subtitle','home_host_subtitle'],true)||in_array($key,$exploreLongFields,true)): ?><textarea name="content[<?= e($key) ?>]"><?= e($content[$key]??'') ?></textarea><?php else: ?><input <?= in_array($key,$exploreImageFields,true)?'type="text" data-explore-image-preview':' ' ?> name="content[<?= e($key) ?>]" value="<?= e($content[$key]??'') ?>" <?= in_array($key,$exploreImageFields,true)?'placeholder="https://... veya uploads/..."':'' ?>><?php endif; ?><?php if(in_array($key,$exploreImageFields,true)): ?><img data-explore-preview-for="<?= e($key) ?>" src="<?= e((string)($content[$key]??'')) ?>" alt="Görsel önizlemesi" style="display:<?= !empty($content[$key])?'block':'none' ?>;width:180px;height:105px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:9px;margin-top:9px;border:1px solid #e1e8e2"><?php endif; ?></label><?php endforeach; ?><button class="btn" type="submit">İçerikleri kaydet</button></div><script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-explore-image-preview]').forEach(function(input){function preview(){var img=document.querySelector('[data-explore-preview-for="'+input.name.replace('content[','').replace(']','')+'"]');if(!img)return;var value=input.value.trim();img.src=value;img.style.display=value?'block':'none';}input.addEventListener('input',preview);});</script></form></main></body></html>